          "message": "Relocate generated code via patch strategy (#1037)\n\n- Relocate generated code via patch strategy.\n- Link device libraries only for the toplevel LLVM module. Others don't need it and it's wasteful.\n- On-demand & lazy device library loading.\n- Add memset and use it for fill.\n- Use single LLVM context for filtering out ghost types.",
